for stealing the election.

00:08:25.137 --> 00:08:27.506
[ As Lindell ]
Mr. President, there's
something you can do

00:08:27.506 --> 00:08:30.042
in martial law
that I highly recommend.

00:08:30.042 --> 00:08:31.877
[ As Trump ]
What do I do
with martial law, Mike?

00:08:31.877 --> 00:08:33.712
[ As Lindell ]
Da...clare it!

00:08:33.712 --> 00:08:35.647
[ Laughter ]
Nope. Didn't work.

00:08:35.647 --> 00:08:39.751
[ Laughter continues ]

00:08:39.751 --> 00:08:42.120
I forced it and it didn't work.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.423
By the way, Lindell is still --

00:08:44.423 --> 00:08:46.192
he's still fighting
that lonely fight.

00:08:46.192 --> 00:08:49.128
He was on OAN the other day,
complaining about Fox News

00:08:49.128 --> 00:08:51.130
and mispronouncing a bunch
of anchors' names,

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:52.364
but, otherwise, you know,
it seems like

00:08:52.364 --> 00:08:53.966
things are going
pretty well for him.

00:08:53.966 --> 00:08:55.134
-This is disgusting!

00:08:55.134 --> 00:08:58.137
Dominion sues good old OAN,
heroes!

00:08:58.137 --> 00:08:59.605 line:0%
OANs are heroes!

00:08:59.605 --> 00:09:00.639 line:0%
Where's Fox?!

00:09:00.706 --> 00:09:02.074 line:0%
Where's Fox?!

00:09:02.074 --> 00:09:04.276 line:0%
Newsmax.
They sue OAN and Newsmax.

00:09:04.276 --> 00:09:07.480 line:0%
Fox, you need to step it up
and help save our country!

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.481 line:0%
I seen stuff
by Jan Bongino on there.

00:09:09.481 --> 00:09:11.817 line:0%
He goes, "I say
whatever I want on my show,"

00:09:11.817 --> 00:09:13.385 line:0%
and people were going after him.

00:09:13.385 --> 00:09:14.719 line:0%
Why don't you call
and interview me?

00:09:14.719 --> 00:09:16.656 line:0%
Sean Hannity told me once,
he said,

00:09:16.656 --> 00:09:18.958 line:0%
"Mike, I can say
anything I want on Fox,

00:09:18.958 --> 00:09:20.526 line:0%
as long as it's the truth."

00:09:20.526 --> 00:09:23.930 line:0%
Well, the truth is, Sean,
we had a Cyber Symposium.

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:27.032 line:0%
And the truth is you're not
saying anything on your show.

00:09:27.032 --> 00:09:28.067 line:0%
Neither are you, Laura.

00:09:28.067 --> 00:09:29.602 line:0%
Trucker tried, a few times,

00:09:29.602 --> 00:09:31.604 line:0%
to talk about the 2020 election.

00:09:31.604 --> 00:09:33.772 line:0%
I give him some credit.

00:09:33.772 --> 00:09:35.274 line:0%
I thought that might be
a breakthrough.

00:09:35.274 --> 00:09:36.542 line:0%
It was a couple of weeks ago.

00:09:36.542 --> 00:09:38.410 line:0%
But none of them are talking!

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:39.878 line:0%
What is Fox doing to you?

00:09:39.878 --> 00:09:42.681 line:0%
Are you guys so -- you're
so worried about your money,

00:09:42.681 --> 00:09:43.882 line:0%
all four of you?

00:09:43.882 --> 00:09:46.385 line:0%
You're so worried
about your money and your job?

00:09:46.385 --> 00:09:49.521
-[ As Lindell ]
I tried to call Jim Bongino
and Drunker Carlson

00:09:49.521 --> 00:09:51.857
and Sean Hamminy, and none
of them would take my call.

00:09:51.857 --> 00:09:55.628
I called the Fox &amp; Friends,
Steve Dooky and Brian Kalamine.

00:09:55.628 --> 00:09:57.929
I even showed up
outside the studio,

00:09:57.929 --> 00:09:59.264
screaming like a lunatic,

00:09:59.264 --> 00:10:02.568
saying, "I want to talk
to Judge Judy Janeane Garofolo!"

00:10:02.568 --> 00:10:03.702
[ Laughter ]

00:10:03.702 --> 00:10:05.838
But even more galling
than Trump's claim

00:10:05.838 --> 00:10:08.407
that he had the vaccine rocking
was his grotesque lie

00:10:08.407 --> 00:10:11.210
that COVID was gone
by the time he left office,

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.877
which it obviously was not.

00:10:12.877 --> 00:10:14.713
-Coronavirus is back.

00:10:14.713 --> 00:10:17.149
If that ever happened to me,
where it came back, okay?

00:10:17.149 --> 00:10:20.319 line:0%
When I left,
it was virtually gone.

00:10:20.319 --> 00:10:23.789
-He thinks our attention spans
are all as short as his.

00:10:23.789 --> 00:10:25.357
We can remember January.

00:10:25.357 --> 00:10:27.392
There were
over 180,000 COVID cases

00:10:27.392 --> 00:10:28.960 line:0%
on Trump's last full day
in office.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:30.463
Those are public numbers.

00:10:30.463 --> 00:10:32.831
We didn't have to sneak into the
National Institutes of Health,

00:10:32.831 --> 00:10:34.466
hack into their
computer systems,

00:10:34.466 --> 00:10:35.868
and smuggle the data out

00:10:35.868 --> 00:10:38.036
in a roll of microfiche hidden
in a coffee can.

00:10:38.036 --> 00:10:39.839
Second use of microfiche
this week.

00:10:39.839 --> 00:10:41.440
Last time I said,
I'd love to hear

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:42.841
Nic Cage say it,
but, if it were a comedy,

00:10:42.841 --> 00:10:44.676
I think it could work
with Owen Wilson, too.

00:10:44.676 --> 00:10:46.645
[ As Wilson ]
Ah, jeez, I hid the microfiche

00:10:46.645 --> 00:10:47.646
in my sock drawer.

00:10:47.646 --> 00:10:49.414
Now, it's gone!

00:10:49.414 --> 00:10:51.750
[ Laughter ]
I haven't done Owen in a while
because, at Impression Camp,

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:52.984
we're working
on some new people.

00:10:52.984 --> 00:10:54.686
For example, my McConaughey
is getting better.

00:10:54.686 --> 00:10:57.122
My instructor told me
it's not the best, but it's

00:10:57.122 --> 00:10:58.758
[ As McConaughey ]
Alright, alright, alright.

00:10:58.758 --> 00:11:00.759
And then, get this --
the next morning,

00:11:00.759 --> 00:11:02.027
he hung himself.

00:11:02.027 --> 00:11:03.963
[ Laughter ]

00:11:03.963 --> 00:11:05.830
My instructor hung himself.

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:08.967
[ Laughter continues ]

00:11:08.967 --> 00:11:10.803
Anyway, it's one thing
for Fox to lie,

00:11:10.803 --> 00:11:11.970
which they do all the time.

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:13.405
It's another to try
to rewrite history

00:11:13.405 --> 00:11:15.374
in such a grotesquely
Orwellian fashion.

00:11:15.374 --> 00:11:17.776
Like you can't just
let Trump come on

00:11:17.776 --> 00:11:20.913
and say COVID had magically
disappeared by the time he left,

00:11:20.913 --> 00:11:22.948
when 400,000 Americans had died.

00:11:22.948 --> 00:11:25.583
You can't just "Men in Black" us
into forgetting about that,

00:11:25.583 --> 00:11:27.920
although, I'm sure they
would try it, if they could.

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:29.621
Tucker Carlson always looks like

00:11:29.621 --> 00:11:32.191
he just accidentally flashed
himself with the neuralyzer.

00:11:32.191 --> 00:11:33.492
Rudy, meanwhile, looks like

00:11:33.492 --> 00:11:35.494
he accidentally sat
on the neuralyzer.

00:11:35.494 --> 00:11:38.197
[ As Giuliani ]
Oh, no! My butt's where
I keep all my memories.

00:11:38.197 --> 00:11:41.133
How can we trust a network
whose hosts and guests

00:11:41.133 --> 00:11:42.768
have a look of shock
on their faces,

00:11:42.768 --> 00:11:44.737
like their dog
just made a phone call?

00:11:44.737 --> 00:11:46.204
[ As Giuliani ]
Rusty, you can talk?

00:11:46.204 --> 00:11:47.206
Who are you calling?

00:11:47.206 --> 00:11:48.607
The police?

00:11:48.607 --> 00:11:50.242
But how did you get
Sting's number?

00:11:50.242 --> 00:11:53.345
[ Laughter ]

00:11:53.345 --> 00:11:56.315
Yeah, see,
Shoemaker and this bit.

00:11:56.315 --> 00:11:59.618
When Rudy hears "the police,"
he thinks the band.

00:11:59.618 --> 00:12:03.222
[ Laughter ]

00:12:03.222 --> 00:12:05.491
The current GOP is very much
the Trump GOP.

00:12:05.491 --> 00:12:07.526
DeSantis is
a perfect example of that.

00:12:07.526 --> 00:12:09.261
He's mimicking
Trump's COVID response.

00:12:09.261 --> 00:12:11.830
As cases and hospitalizations
reach new records,

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.766
he's downplaying the threat
and refusing

00:12:13.766 --> 00:12:16.535
basic mitigation efforts that
would help keep people safe.

00:12:16.535 --> 00:12:18.236
It's exactly what Trump did
and, now, they're just

00:12:18.236 --> 00:12:20.372
flagrantly lying about it
and trying to rewrite history.

00:12:20.372 --> 00:12:21.940
Basically, their attitude is...

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:23.875 line:0%
-"I can say
anything I want on Fox."

00:12:23.875 --> 00:12:25.310
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:29.081
♪♪

00:12:29.081 --> 00:12:30.582
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:12:30.582 --> 00:12:31.883
over two million meals a year

00:12:31.883 --> 00:12:33.952
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:12:33.952 --> 00:12:35.287
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:12:35.287 --> 00:12:37.189
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:12:37.189 --> 00:12:39.224
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:12:39.224 --> 00:12:42.094
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

